# Keep small config/input files
# NOTE: real patient .ped files MUST stay out of the repo.
# Only the synthetic example pedigree (and example Cases sheet) are whitelisted.
!inputs/pedigree_synthetic_example.ped
!inputs/Cases_example.txt
!inputs/*.toml
!inputs/config.toml

# Keep documentation
!*.md
!README*

